        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-zinc-50 dark:bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800">
          <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-base text-zinc-950 dark:text-white mb-2">
            2. Vaikeustaso &amp; pisteytys
